<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 1.9 pct in Dec.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 1.9 pct in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 1.9 percent in December, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   Dec 96     Year to Date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +1.9	 +0.4</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +3.1	 +1.9</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +0.7	 -1.3</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
